{
  "_about": [
    "One entry per MLB park, keyed by the venue name MLB's stats feed uses;",
    "venue_id is MLB's id for the same place, used only when the name on the",
    "feed does not match (parks get renamed). lat/lon: the ballpark.",
    "cf_bearing: compass degrees from home plate toward centre field (0 =",
    "north, 90 = east). roof: 'open' (no roof), 'retractable' (the script",
    "cannot know whether it is shut -- tick Roof shut on the sheet if it is),",
    "or 'fixed' (always shut; the script sets dome: true).",
    "The bearings are APPROXIMATE and the script prints, for every game, the",
    "raw compass wind and the direction it resolved to, so they can be checked",
    "against the park diagram on Outlier and corrected here. Each bearing",
    "carries a 'verified' flag; flip it to true once a park has been checked."
  ],
